\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Hallelujah! Sabbath morning,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Day of gladness, time of rest!
\par Free of sorrow, free of mourning,
\par Let us worship and be blessed.
\par May this day refresh our soul
\par When we all God's name extol.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. May we leave our earthly business
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Concentrate on God alone!
\par May he take away our blindness,
\par Till we see him on the throne!
\par In his presence rest our mind
\par Till his perfect peace we find.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. In the fellowship of others
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Let us worship in God's house,
\par Where his spirit sweetly gathers
\par Those who openly expose
\par All their being unto the Lord,
\par And he feeds them with his word.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Bless the preaching of your servant;
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Put your word upon his tongue.
\par By your grace renew your promise
\par As we praise you with our song,
\par As your message now we hear
\par And we offer you our pray'r.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Keep us till the day is over
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 In your presence and your peace,
\par May the weary strength recover;
\par Let our faith and hope increase,
\par Till in your eternal rest
\par \pard     We may be forever blessed.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

